. Require review for low confidence, high-risk types, degraded cameras, new cameras, or enforcement impact.\n3. Return review flag, reasons, threshold, and queue.\n\n## Available Implementation\n\nThis skill is implemented as an atomic standalone script in its own `scripts/run.py`. The script contains the executable logic for this skill and must not import shared `src`, `tools`, or registry modules.\n\n## Inputs\n\n- `event`\n- `camera_health`\n- Optional `review_threshold`\n\nConfig:\n- `default_review_threshold`\n- `review_thresholds.<event_type>`\n- `high_risk_event_types`\n\n## Outputs\n\nReturns `event_id`, `review_required`, `reasons`, `review_threshold`, and `queue`.\n\n## Failure Modes\n\nThe current implementation tolerates missing optional config and falls back to threshold `0.85`.\n\n## Constraints\n\nDo not merge duplicate events or generate evidence.\n","additional_kwargs":{},"response_metadata":{},"type":"tool","name":"read_file","id":"78228735-daa0-4a11-97f2-d97a3d096d79","tool_call_id":"call_e2451333c80e4688ac678bff","artifact":null,"status":"success"},{"content":"现在执行用户提供的 bash 命令来测试该 skill 的真实链路：\n\n","additional_kwargs":{"refusal":null},"response_metadata":{"token_usage":{"completion_tokens":315,"prompt_tokens":9730,"total_tokens":10045,"completion_tokens_details":{"accepted_prediction_tokens":null,"audio_tokens":null,"reasoning_tokens":0,"rejected_prediction_tokens":null,"text_tokens":315},"prompt_tokens_details":{"audio_tokens":null,"cached_tokens":null,"text_tokens":9730}},"model_provider":"openai","model_name":"qwen3.5-plus","system_fingerprint":null,"id":"chatcmpl-6a64a6a5-9175-96e6-add5-1d8e9ae55afa","finish_reason":"tool_calls","logprobs":null},"type":"ai","name":null,"id":"lc_run--019e6294-b918-7a71-8e21-3e4425b7e183-0","tool_calls":[{"name":"bash","args":{"description":"执行 human-review-routing skill 的测试命令","command":"mkdir -p /mnt/user-data/outputs/human-review-routing /mnt/user-data/workspace/human-review-routing\npython - <<'PY'\nimport