data: {"messages":[{"content":"请测试 `human-review-routing` skill 的 Agent 真链路。\n\n必须严格执行：\n1. 先调用 read_file 读取 `/mnt/skills/custom/human-review-routing/SKILL.md`。\n2. 再调用 bash 执行下面这段命令，不要改路径，不要省略任何输出文件。\n3. 执行完成后读取 `/mnt/user-data/outputs/human-review-routing/result.json`，并在最终回复中返回这个 JSON 的内容和简短结论。\n\n```bash\nmkdir -p /mnt/user-data/outputs/human-review-routing /mnt/user-data/workspace/human-review-routing\npython - <<'PY'\nimport json, pathlib\nevent = {\"event_id\":\"EVT_REVIEW_001\",\"event_type\":\"fight\",\"confidence\":0.62,\"severity\":\"high\",\"enforcement_impact\":True}\nhealth = {\"health_status\":\"degraded\",\"health_score\":0.55,\"issues\":[\"blurred\"]}\npathlib.Path('/mnt/user-data/workspace/human-review-routing').mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True)\njson.dump(event, open('/mnt/user-data/workspace/human-review-routing/event.json','w'), ensure_ascii=False, indent=2)\njson.dump(health, open('/mnt/user-data/workspace/human-review-routing/health.json','w'), ensure_ascii=False, indent=2)\nPY\npython /mnt/skills/custom/human-review-routing/scripts/run.py --event-json /mnt/user-data/workspace/human-review-routing/event.json --camera-health-json /mnt/user-data/workspace/human-review-routing/health.json --config /mnt/skills/custom/configs/deerflow_config.json --output /mnt/user-data/outputs/human-review-routing/result.json\n```\n\n成功判定：必须能看到 read_file 读取该 SKILL.md、bash 执行该 skill 入口、并生成 `/mnt/user-data/outputs/human-review-routing/result.json`。","additional_kwargs":{},"response_metadata":{},"type":"human","name":null,"id":"a2e904d7-ecde-4cce-9195-36f93c0ebf37"},{"content":"","additional_kwargs":{"refusal":null},"response_metadata":{"token_usage":{"completion_tokens":93,"prompt_tokens":9181,"total_tokens":9274,"completion_tokens_details":{"accepted_prediction_tokens":null,"audio_tokens":null,"reasoning_tokens":33,"rejected_prediction_tokens":null,"text_tokens":93},"prompt_tokens_details":{"audio_tokens":null,"cached_tokens":null,"text_tokens":9181}},"model_provid